    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17735" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτο-κάβδᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>done carelessly,
				slovenly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1415b38
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. σκάφος</span> a bark
				<i>built offhand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				745
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως</span>
			<i>extempore,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ εὐόγκων λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1408a12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοκάβδαλοι, οἱ,</span>
